<title>JAPAN: Japan Oct aluminium alloy output, shipments rise.</title>
<headline>Japan Oct aluminium alloy output, shipments rise.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's output and shipments of aluminium alloy in October rose from the same month a year ago while inventories fell, the Japan Aluminium Alloy Refiners Association said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The October figures were as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		   Oct 96	 yr/yr change     Sept 96</p>
<p> Output	  82,431	  +8.8 pct	   78,352</p>
<p> Shipments     82,302	  +7.3 pct	   79,811</p>
<p> Inventories   24,174	  -7.6 pct	   23,393</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-7391</p>
</text>
